--------TurbSim v2.00.* Input File------------------------
DTU 10 MW RWT on 158 m hybrid tower; R7 formal Chapter 3 36-case production
---------Runtime Options-----------------------------------
False         Echo          - Echo input data to <RootName>.ech (flag)
104729         RandSeed1     - First random seed (-2147483648 to 2147483647)
RanLux        RandSeed2     - Second random seed or alternative pRNG
False         WrBHHTP       - Write hub-height binary turbulence parameters?
True          WrFHHTP       - Write hub-height formatted turbulence parameters?
False         WrADHH        - Write AeroDyn hub-height time series?
True          WrADFF        - Write TurbSim/AeroDyn full-field .bts file?
False         WrBLFF        - Write Bladed-style .wnd file?
False         WrADTWR       - Write tower time series?
False         WrFMTFF       - Write formatted full-field velocity components?
False         WrACT         - Write coherent turbulence time steps?
True          Clockwise     - Clockwise rotation looking downwind?
1             ScaleIEC      - Scale IEC output to exact target at hub

--------Turbine/Model Specifications-----------------------
51            NumGrid_Z     - Vertical grid-point matrix dimension
51            NumGrid_Y     - Horizontal grid-point matrix dimension
0.025         TimeStep      - Time step [s]
700.0         AnalysisTime  - Total generated time [s]
"ALL"         UsableTime    - Usable length of output time series [s]
161.368806    HubHt         - Hub height [m]
200.0         GridHeight    - Grid height [m]
200.0         GridWidth     - Grid width [m]
0.0           VFlowAng      - Vertical mean flow angle [deg]
0.0           HFlowAng      - Horizontal mean flow angle [deg]

--------Meteorological Boundary Conditions-------------------
"IECKAI"      TurbModel     - IEC Kaimal turbulence model
"unused"      UserFile      - User-defined spectra/time-series file
"1-ED3"       IECstandard   - IEC 61400-1 third edition, DTU 10 MW Class IA
"A"           IECturbc      - IEC turbulence category A; Iref=0.16
"NTM" IEC_WindType - IEC turbulence type
"default"     ETMc          - ETM c=2 m/s
"PL"          WindProfileType - Power-law mean profile
"unused"      ProfileFile   - User-defined profile file
161.368806    RefHt         - Reference height [m]
7.5      URef          - Mean wind speed at reference height [m/s]
450.0         ZJetMax       - Low-level-jet height [m], unused
0.20          PLExp         - IEC design power-law exponent
"default"     Z0            - Surface roughness length [m]

--------Non-IEC Meteorological Boundary Conditions------------
"default"     Latitude      - Site latitude [deg]
0.0           RICH_NO       - Neutral stability for IECKAI
"default"     UStar         - Friction velocity [m/s]
"default"     ZI            - Mixing-layer depth [m]
"default"     PC_UW         - Hub mean u'w' Reynolds stress [m^2/s^2]
"default"     PC_UV         - Hub mean u'v' Reynolds stress [m^2/s^2]
"default"     PC_VW         - Hub mean v'w' Reynolds stress [m^2/s^2]

--------Spatial Coherence Parameters----------------------------
"IEC"         SCMod1        - u-component coherence model
"IEC"         SCMod2        - v-component coherence model
"IEC"         SCMod3        - w-component coherence model
"default"     InCDec1       - u-component coherence parameters
"default"     InCDec2       - v-component coherence parameters
"default"     InCDec3       - w-component coherence parameters
"default"     CohExp        - Coherence exponent

--------Coherent Turbulence Scaling Parameters-------------------
"unused"      CTEventPath   - Coherent-event path, unused
"random"      CTEventFile   - Coherent-event type, unused
True          Randomize      - Randomize coherent event, unused
1.0           DistScl        - Event scale, unused
0.5           CTLy           - Event lateral location, unused
0.5           CTLz           - Event vertical location, unused
30.0          CTStartTime   - Event start time, unused

